#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/cli/auto.py:140
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"--backend auto: chose {backend!r} — first available in the native-first "
"preference order ({candidates}); available here: {here}."
msgstr ""
"--backend auto：选择了 "
"{backend!r}——原生优先偏好顺序（{candidates}）中的第一个可用项；此处可用：{here}。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/cli/auto.py:154
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"no ASR backend is available on this machine; `--backend auto` found none "
"of: {backends}.\n"
"  Install a system `whisper-cli` + a ggml GPU plugin (on macOS, `brew "
"install whisper-cpp`; on Linux, e.g. a distro `whisper-cpp` plus `ggml-"
"cuda`/`ggml-vulkan`; see docs/adr/0005), or pass an explicit `--backend "
"<id>`."
msgstr ""
"此机器上没有可用的 ASR 后端；`--backend auto` 在以下项中一个也没找到：{backends}。\n"
"  请安装系统级 `whisper-cli` 和一个 ggml GPU 插件（macOS 上执行 `brew install whisper-"
"cpp`；Linux 上例如发行版的 `whisper-cpp` 加 `ggml-cuda`/`ggml-vulkan`；参见 "
"docs/adr/0005），或显式传入 `--backend <id>`。"

