"clear-record records, transcribes and reviews meetings locally. Your own "
"tape becomes a transcript under Projects → Meetings, and — once an agent "
"endpoint is connected — minutes under that project's Minutes. Nothing "
"here is required before you start; this path gets transcription ready, "
"connects an MCP harness, and ends with an acceptance test."
msgstr ""
"clear-record 在本地录制、转写并审阅会议。你自己的录音会在「项目 → "
"会议」下变成转写文本；连接智能体端点后，还会在该项目的「纪要」下生成纪要。开始前无需完成任何步骤；这条路径会让转写就绪、连接 MCP "
"宿主，并以一次验收测试收尾。"

